 name: [BSD 3-Clause License (Theodore Ts'o)](https://github.com/org-metaeffekt/metaeffekt-universe/blob/main/src/main/resources/ae-universe/[b]/README.md#user-content-BSD-3-Clause-License-(Theodore-Ts'o):~:text=BSD%203%2DClause%20License%20(Theodore%20Ts'o))\nshort name: BSD-3-Clause-Theodore-Ts'o\nmarkers: Do Not Promote Marker, General Terms Matches Marker, Written Permission Required (for promotion/endorsement) Marker, Written Permission Required Marker\ncategory: BSD 3 Clause\nOSI status: _none_\n\n**ScanCode**\nmatched id: [bsd-new](https://github.com/nexB/scancode-toolkit/blob/develop/src/licensedcode/data/licenses/bsd-new.LICENSE)\n\n**Comment**\n+1 to add.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2892211334/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3114124432","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2702#issuecomment-3114124432","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2702","id":3114124432,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE865ncSQ","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-24T16:35:29Z","updated_at":"2025-07-24T21:00:45Z","body":"agreed the key differences:\n```diff\n1. Redistributions of source code must retain the above copyright notice,\n-  this list of conditions and the following disclaimer.\n+  and the entire permission notice in its entirety, including the disclaimer of warranties.\n```\n\nas well as:\n```diff\n- AND FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE ARE DISCLAIMED\n+ AND FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, ALL OF WHICH ARE HEREBY DISCLAIMED\n```\nWhile I don't really see either of the above as being legally, substantively different - I'm struggling with the idea of adding markup for these, particularly the first one.\n\nand \n```diff\n- IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHOR BE LIABLE FOR ANY ... DAMAGES ... HOWEVER CAUSED AND ON ANY THEORY OF LIABILITY, ... EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGE.\n+ IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHOR BE LIABLE FOR ANY ... DAMAGES ... HOWEVER CAUSED AND ON ANY THEORY OF LIABILITY, ... EVEN IF **NOT** ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGE.\n```\nI have truncated the sentence to make it easier to read/compare.\nThis is bizarre, as the addition of \"NOT\" doesn't really make sense and I wonder if this was some form of mistake or misreading?\n\nwould appreciate some other thoughts on this one!  \n@swinslow @Pizza-Ria @richardfontana ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3114124432/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3114156204","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2702#i